  "claim_scope": "Matched validation-only comparison of the frozen compact 7D action representation against a minimal 17D compiled-obstacle-frame representation for the same shared per-row five-action future-risk critic. This isolates action observability; it is not correction, full-episode, deployment, untouched-test, formal-safety, or CBF evidence.",
